    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826560/extras/4a552d0cc9488f42820ec87af40851a6.avif?t=1755650722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Mayoi Shoutengai is a first-person horror game where you must escape from a terrifying shopping district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it begins, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of a story unite in the &quot;SukuuMono&quot; series</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is Mayoi Shoutengai, a mysterious shopping district located on Kannagi Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl named Satsuki Kuon, trapped in Mayoi Shoutengai, awakens to find no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with Shiki, who is also trapped, she searches for an escape from the endless maze of storefronts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWe have to get out of here soon\u2026 I have a really bad feeling\u2026\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Satsuki and Shiki escape the horrors of Mayoi Shoutengai?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Although part of the Nestbound Series, each title can be enjoyed as a standalone experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Presentation</strong><br>Unexplainable phenomena occur throughout the Lost Shopping Street.<br>Experience a brand-new kind of fear like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode</strong><br>Break all the seams and escape as fast as you can!<br>Compete with other players for the fastest clear time in the rankings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Three different endings await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong><br>Around 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Notes</strong><br>This title includes <i>Supporter Content</i>, which can be toggled on or off from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Streaming and Content Creation</strong><br>All games by <i>Actor</i> may be streamed or shared without needing prior permission.<br>We would love for more people to discover and enjoy our games,<br>so if possible, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could mention the store page when posting or streaming! (Of course, this is entirely optional.)</p>",
